    "text": "herelexingtonky.com\nwebsite\nMadison County, Kentucky\nTragic Multi-Vehicle Accident on I-75 Claims Young Life\n20 hours ago\nA devastating multi-vehicle collision on I-75 in Madison County resulted in the tragic death of 16-year-old Tristan Brown. The accident occurred amidst heavy traffic, involving several vehicles and leading to significant injuries and disruptions. The Kentucky State Police are investigating the circumstances of the crash as the community mourns the loss of a young life.",
